   You may download and use the Software for personal play.


2. INTEROPERATION GRANT

   Other mods, and players' own configurations, need to work alongside Mouse
   Aim Flight. Nothing in Section 1 is intended to restrict that, and this
   section grants the rights needed to do it.

   You are granted a perpetual, worldwide, royalty-free, irrevocable right to:

   (a) Write separate mods, plugins, tools, or libraries that interoperate
       with Mouse Aim Flight Redux through its public API, including ones that
       provide flight modes or controllers through interfaces it exposes for
       that purpose.

   (b) Write ModuleManager patches and configuration files that change Mouse
       Aim Flight's settings or behaviour.

   (c) Use Mouse Aim Flight Redux's configuration node names, setting keys, and
       documented public API for the purposes of (a) and (b).

   (d) Distribute, sell, and license the work described in (a) and (b) on any
       terms you choose, through any channel, including for commercial
       purposes.

   You own that work. This license claims no ownership over, and imposes no
   licensing terms on, work you create. Interoperating with Mouse Aim Flight Redux
   does not make it a derivative work of the Software, and no attribution to
   Mouse Aim Flight Redux is required.

   This grant is irrevocable: it cannot be withdrawn from work already
   published, and it survives any future change to this license.


3. LIMITS OF THE GRANT

   Section 2 does not permit you to:

   (a) Redistribute the Software's own code, binaries, or bundled assets,
       whether modified or unmodified, except as allowed in Section 4.

   (b) Present your work in a way that implies it is Mouse Aim Flight Redux itself,
       or that it is endorsed by or affiliated with the project.


4. MOD MANAGER AND MODPACK INCLUSION

   You may list Mouse Aim Flight Redux in a mod manager index, or include it in a
   modpack, free or paid, provided that all of the following hold:

   (a) The index or modpack fetches Mouse Aim Flight Redux from an official
       distribution page operated or authorised by the copyright holder. The
       end user's client performs the download; the index or modpack carries a
       reference, not the file. CKAN metadata is the intended example.

   (b) The index or modpack does not bundle, mirror, re-host, or otherwise
       include a copy of the Software.

   (c) Mouse Aim Flight Redux is distributed unmodified. You may not patch,
       repackage, strip, recompile, or alter it in any way.

   (d) Configuration files and patches shipped alongside are unaffected by
       this section and remain governed by Section 2.

   This permission is automatically revoked for any index or modpack that
   breaches (a) through (c).


